## 🚀 Features

### **Intelligent Leg Selection**
- ✅ **Direction-aware coverage:** "How often does this player go over/under this line?"
- ✅ **Fresh data every time:** Fetches 500-600 props from SportsGameOdds
- ✅ **Simple transparent scoring:** Coverage + pitcher quality (no ML black box)
- ✅ **Pitcher-aware matchups:** ERA-based opponent adjustments
- ✅ **Handedness splits:** Lefty vs righty performance factored in

### **Smart Filtering**
- ✅ **Prop type exclusions:** stolenBases_under, walks_under (always too juiced)
- ✅ **Odds range filter:** -500 to +500 (eliminates garbage props)
- ✅ **Lineup consistency:** Minimum 70% games with 3+ AB
- ✅ **Game start buffer:** 15-minute cutoff to avoid late scratches
- ✅ **IL/DFA integration:** Transaction wire polling

### **Parlay Construction**
- ✅ Optimized for 4-leg parlays at +1000 to +1400 odds
- ✅ Avoids same-game conflicts (max 2-3 legs per game)
- ✅ Balances over/under distribution
- ⚠️ **Currently broken** - odds too juiced, need MIN_COV adjustment

### **Automated Pipeline**
- ✅ **9 AM ET:** Resolve yesterday's bets + fetch fresh props + build parlays
- ✅ **12 PM ET:** Refresh odds and lineups (skip resolution - 2x faster)
- ✅ **5:30 PM ET:** Final refresh before games (skip resolution - 2x faster)
- ✅ **Manual regenerate:** Web UI button (skip resolution - 3x faster)

